<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85373" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-στονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>much-sighing,
			mournful,</i> of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				845
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>noisy,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νεῖλος</span>
			f.l. for foreg. in <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				175
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶδμα . . πολυστόνου Ἀμφιτρίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					14.644
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of things,
				<i>causing many sighs, mournful, grievous,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήδεα, Ἔρις, ἰός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.445
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.451
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξιφέων πολύστονον ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					3.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Pae.</u>
					6.99
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. φάτις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					380
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τροία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1346
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρά, δαίμων, Ἐρινύς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				996
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				212
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				835
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.279
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
